# Incident Timeline

This timeline represents the attacker activity identified during the Boogeyman 3 Incident Response investigation.

| Time | Event |
|------|-------|
| Aug 29-30 2023 | Initial compromise activity detected |
| 23:51 | Malicious document executed on CEO workstation |
| 23:51 | mshta.exe executed stage 1 payload |
| 23:51 | Payload copied using xcopy.exe to AppData Temp directory |
| 23:51 | review.dat executed using rundll32.exe |
| 23:51 | C2 communication established with attacker infrastructure |
| Later | Persistence created using scheduled task "Review" |
| Later | Attacker performed host enumeration |
| Later | Attacker downloaded PowerView and Mimikatz |
| Later | UAC bypass performed using fodhelper.exe |
| Later | Credentials dumped from compromised workstation |
| Later | Lateral movement performed using stolen credentials |
| Later | WKSTN-1327 compromised |
| Later | Additional credential dumping performed |
| Later | Domain Controller targeted |
| Later | DCSync attack performed against domain |
| Final stage | Ransomware payload downloaded |
